                                                "sense_id": "9c2c01bc-72d1-33e0-86a3-7d32792c2c82",
                                                "text": "the sanguine hue of the poppy and the hibiscus, the gold of the daisy and dandelion, the dark green of the sorrage on either side, and the blue and purple of the blossoming mulberry and sycamore"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1eaab95d-5afb-4a48-b297-059884025a51",
                                                "sense_id": "9c2c01bc-72d1-33e0-86a3-7d32792c2c82",
                                                "text": "There are asexual variants among all sorts of creatures, including jellyfish, dandelions, lichens and lizards."
